# 예측·학습 캐시, 결과와 실험 조합 설정은 로컬 또는 별도 스토리지에 보관한다.
backend/analysis/chart/experiments/cache/
backend/analysis/chart/experiments/train_src/cache/
backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/*
!backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/
!backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/README.md
!backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/2026-06-progress-roadmap.md
!backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/legacy_screening/
backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/legacy_screening/*
!backend/analysis/chart/experiments/results/legacy_screening/SELECTION_REPORT.md
